Then, Monday came.
That was my first day at the office.
I woke up early in the morning.
I went to the office by bus.
My new office was very big.
I went inside.
Rohan came to meet me.
He showed me my desk.
Then I logged in on the computer.
At first, I felt a little nervous.
He was my first colleague.
His name is Rohan.
He spoke to me very nicely.
He helped me a lot on the first day.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay listened to my story carefully.
Sanjay smiled.
He said, "Maya, your first week was very nice."
I also smiled.
Now our tea was finished.
We gave money to the tea vendor.
